  "name": "Witch Doctor Overflowing Juju raises the spell power scaling of Shadowflare, Bad Juju, Wrath and Arrow",
  "contract": [
    "Overflowing Juju 707405: 'Increases the spell power scaling of Malefic Wrath, Shadowflare, and Bad Juju by",
    "$s1%.' ($s1 = 20). Effect[0] is aura 108 SPELLMOD_BONUS_MULTIPLIER, which the engine applies to the native",
    "spell power coefficient; every Witch Doctor coefficient row has its native BonusMultiplier zeroed",
    "(AscensionWitchDoctorCompletion.cpp:586-588) and is folded into the effect base value instead",
    "(ModifySpellEffectBaseValue, AscensionWitchDoctorCompletion.cpp:646-660), so the talent scaled nothing:",
    "+0.000% at 60000 spell power in all three cycle 9 sweep entries. The fix multiplies the folded spell power",
    "coefficient by the talent's percent for the spells its corrected class mask (4 | 1024, 33792, 0) covers.",
    "Malefic Arrow (IsArrow, SpellFamilyFlags[1] 0x80000000) shares the Malefic Wrath bit 32768 and stands in",
    "for Malefic Wrath, so it is scaled too (contributor decision 2026-11-22, ADR 0031). Hexfire Wrath 807480",
    "(word 1 32768) is scaled: its tooltip says it 'Scales with modifiers to Malefic Wrath'.",
    "Each spell is cast once before the talent is learned (control arm) and once after; the second hit, read",
    "as the cumulative total minus the first (relative_to) over the first (ratio_to), must be 1.18 to 1.22 at",
    "60000 spell power, where the base, Spirit and attack power terms are at most about 1.2% of a hit and the",
    "same in both casts (sweep: Shadowflare 21069, Bad Juju 60235, Malefic Wrath 37525 per hit; fixed ratios",
    "about 1.199). Before the fix every ratio is 1.000. The Arrow ratio must be 1.16 to 1.22: its unscaled",
    "ranged attack power and base terms are a larger share of a hit (about 1.19). Hexfire Wrath is read on its",
    "direct hit (periodic false); a",
    "real Hexfire with Hexfire Adept 704500 known gives the ready aura 503626 that turns Malefic Wrath into it.",
    "823764 removes partial resists; 984954 removes spell critical strikes on the doctor; the archer's",
    "ranged_crit_rating makes every Arrow a critical strike, so both Arrow hits carry the same multiplier.",
    "Order: the archer's Arrows first, then the doctor's Shadowflare, Bad Juju and Malefic Wrath, then the",
    "talent is unlearned for the Hexfire Wrath control cast, and the Serpent Ward (10000 ms) is waited out",
    "before the talent is learned again for the second Hexfire Wrath."
  ],
